<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <!--
        The counters a formation or amendment file actually passes through.

        Only six of the twelve records below are the Ministry. The rest are the
        bodies that block a Registrar filing anyway: the notary who authenticates
        a simple company's contract, the Bar Association whose ID the
        registration agent must produce at nearly every window, Al-Rasheed Bank
        where the capital is deposited and the fees are paid, the Translators
        Association and the Foreign Ministry's certifications directorate that a
        foreign parent's papers must pass through, the gazette, and the daily
        newspapers a formation decision is published in. This is why
        legal.gov.body.body_type_id is a record and not a Selection: half of the
        list is not a ministry at all.
    -->
    <data noupdate="1">

        <!-- ============================================================
             The Ministry and its Registrar
             ============================================================ -->

